REFERENCE  (J,EPJ/A,62,90,2026)
           #doi:10.1140/epja/s10050-026-01826-3
REL-REF    (N,23656001,P.Torres-Sanchez+,J,PR/C,107,064617,2023)
            14N(n,p)14C measured in the same irradiation
FACILITY   (SYNCY,2ZZZCER) CERN nTOF facility EAR-2
            Protons accelerated to 20 GeV/c
INC-SOURCE (SPALL) Neutrons produced in a massive Pb target
SAMPLE     - KCl (natural potassium chloride, purity>99.5%)
             deposited onto Al foils (100 um).
           - 235U (enriched to 99.934%, 123.2+/-0.5 nm,
             (3.047+/-0.013)E+17 at/cm2 electrodeposited onto
             Al (30.0+/-1.0 um).
           - 10B4C (enriched to >99.9%, (1.69+/-0.09)E+17 at/cm2)
             deposited onto Mylar (100.0+/-1.0 um).
DETECTOR   (IOCH) A stack of microMEGAS detector (9.5 cm
            diam.) including one 235U, one 10B, two N samples as
            well as KCl samples
METHOD     (TOF) Flight path length of 19.35 m for 235U sample
            position in MicroMegas
MONITOR    (5-B-10(N,A)3-LI-7,,SIG)
MONIT-REF  (,A.D.Carlson+,J,NDS,148,143,2018)
